{
 "title": "动态列表：List",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "数组的长度是固定的。对于会增长和缩小的数据，有 **`List[T]`**：`List[i32]()` 创建一个空列表，`push` 添加，`len` 是长度，`list[i]` 取出一个元素。列表把数据放在堆上，用完后会自动清理。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    xs = List[i32]()",
    "    xs.push(10)",
    "    xs.push(20)",
    "    xs.push(30)",
    "    print(\"len:\", xs.len)",
    "    print(\"second:\", xs[1])",
    "    for x in xs:",
    "        print(x)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "len: 3",
    "second: 20",
    "10",
    "20",
    "30"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c04-l06-x1",
   "prompt": "把 1 到 5 的平方加入 `squares` 列表，并全部输出。",
   "starter": [
    "fn main():",
    "    squares = List[i32]()",
    "    for x in squares:",
    "        print(x)"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "fn main():",
    "    squares = List[i32]()",
    "    for i in 1..=5:",
    "        squares.push(i * i)",
    "    for x in squares:",
    "        print(x)"
   ],
   "hint": "先在 `for i in 1..=5:` 里执行 `squares.push(i * i)`。",
   "expected": [
    "1",
    "4",
    "9",
    "16",
    "25"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c04-l06-q1",
   "q": "哪种结构可以在程序运行时增长？",
   "options": [
    "`[4]i32` 数组",
    "`List[i32]`",
    "元组"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "数组和元组是固定的；`List` 会增长。"
  }
 ]
}
